WEBVTT

00:00:02.606 --> 00:00:18.606
My name is Nico Cerioni and this is my Project 1. I recommend watch/defer on Coherent Corp.. As of September 15th, 2026, my conditional valuation range is $45 to $154 per share versus the $271.17 market reference.

00:00:18.824 --> 00:00:33.824
If I change the gross margin shift to one percentage point, it increases the value from $75.60 to $80.61. Higher gross profit increases EBIT after-tax free cash flow to firm and value.

00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:45.625
Restoring it back to base, and then click on Growth Funding Stress. The faster growth also consumes cash. This stress exceeds model financing capacity, triggering a red funding failure seen right here.

00:00:45.948 --> 00:00:49.948
Its conditional value cannot support initiation.

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:58.590
When I go back to the base, it shows that the checks pass with this green marker right here.

00:01:00.687 --> 00:01:09.687
Reset restores passing checks. These establish internal consistency but not forecast accuracy necessarily.

00:01:09.688 --> 00:01:25.020
Scrolling down, we have the scenario table. My forecast assumes revenue growth moderates from 35% to 8% over the next five years. Gross margin improves from 39% to 42%, and CapEx declines from 14% to 7% of revenue.

00:01:25.866 --> 00:01:31.866
The thesis requires expanding capacity to generate orders, manufacturing efficiencies, and better cash conversion.

00:01:35.753 --> 00:01:42.753
Up here, we have the risk table. By expanding why Coherent should wait.

00:01:42.991 --> 00:01:57.991
We have 3 risks that support waiting. First, CapEx may not pay off. Slower AI infrastructure spending could leave excess capacity and inventory, while debt obligations remain. Second, FY26 OCF.

00:01:57.957 --> 00:02:13.957
was only about 80 million against $1.1 billion of CapEx. OCF less CapEx was negative by roughly $1 billion. Third, two customers supplied 32% of revenue for Coherent Corp., creating order and negotiating risk.

00:02:14.227 --> 00:02:19.227
Data center and communication supplied 74%, including non-AI businesses.

00:02:22.349 --> 00:02:24.349
Scrolling down, we have the forecast.

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:33.190
Enterprise to value per share, market implied expectations, sensitivity analysis, WACC–growth sensitivity.

00:02:36.237 --> 00:02:51.237
And down here, the WACC build, and terminal challenge. The base uses 11.8% WACC and 3% terminal growth. Terminal value represents 87% of EV, making long-term assumptions especially consequential.

00:02:52.069 --> 00:03:00.069
multiples provide different references because business mix and profitability differ. I do not average them into the DCF.

00:03:02.006 --> 00:03:17.006
My committee ask is no initiation at the reference price. Reconsider after two reporting dates show improving trailing-year OCF less CapEx, supported utilization and credible funding, plus a refreshed valuation offering a 25% margin of safety.

00:03:17.696 --> 00:03:19.696
A lower price alone is insufficient.

00:03:20.541 --> 00:03:23.541
Coherent Corp. must demonstrate sustainable cash returns.

00:03:23.747 --> 00:03:26.747
consider investing in the stock.
